{"id":"betragen","lemma":"Betragen","pos":"noun","rank":2647,"glosses":["behavior, demeanor, conduct","(general) conduct"],"ipa":"/bəˈtʁaːɡən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/45/De-Betragen.ogg/De-Betragen.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Betragens"},"examples":[{"text":"Dein Betragen war schändlich.","en":"Your behavior was disgraceful.","words":[{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"shameful"}]},{"text":"Sie hat sich ganz abscheulich betragen.","en":"She behaved quite abominably.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"entire"},{"g":"abominable, hideous"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe mit deinen Eltern über dein Betragen gesprochen.","en":"I've spoken to your parents about your behavior.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},{"g":"parents"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"to speak","l":"sprechen"}]},{"text":"Sein herrisches Betragen macht mich wütend.","en":"His overbearing manner infuriates me.","words":[{"g":"to be"},null,null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"angrily, furiously"}]},{"text":"Ihr Betragen ist nicht normal für ein junges Mädchen.","en":"Her behavior isn't normal for a young girl.","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"ordinarily"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"young","l":"jung"},{"g":"girl"}]}]}